Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 16:06:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launcher): agent tree profiles UI in Advanced Settings

Adds GET /api/agents/tree, POST /api/agents/apply, PUT/DELETE
/api/agents/profile endpoints to the launcher backend and an Agent
Trees & Profiles card to the Advanced Settings page: pick a profile,
apply it to the live tree, edit defaults/agents/dispatch rules, and
save back to the profile. Profiles live under agents.profiles with
agents.active_profile recording the applied tree.
